{
  "description": "Phase-2 ingestion-copilot evaluation fixtures. 'raw' is model-output-shaped text (the real 12-field EvidenceExtractionSchema), 'source' the authorized source record the claims must trace back to. The runner asserts the exact deterministic status, the per-field verification outcome and the issue-code set - so both silent acceptance and blanket rejection fail. Metrics computed from this set: schema acceptance, field-level verification rate, unsupported-claim detection (flagged), locator-source semantics (page numbers cannot back claims).",
